WEBVTT

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:48.630
Huh? The goldenrain tree...
When did it...

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:50.510
Where's Asmita?

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:51.670
Huh.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:54.290
So you think you can overcome your six senses,

00:01:54.290 --> 00:01:57.550
even for a moment, to strike against me?

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:00.800
I can't say I respect your reason.

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.400
What?

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:07.310
Then my fight against you was all in my head?

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:11.130
Who knows where illusion begins
and where it ends.

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:14.010
You could say that it was all reality to you,

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:15.820
one who exists as an ethereal being.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:21.610
Behold. The only living thing in this Underworld,
the goldenrain tree,

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:25.790
has responded to your Cosmo
and has borne its final fruit.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:30.230
This is the fruit that the Master of Jamir sought.

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:32.580
Bring him as many as you can.

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.400
I'll see you above ground,

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:37.710
Pegasus Saint.

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:49.310
Whoa, what? Why is this suddenly happening?

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:51.770
Was I unconscious?

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:55.820
Tenma!

00:02:58.460 --> 00:02:59.150
Hey!

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.580
Why are you such a mess?

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:03.800
Yato...

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:07.160
These goldenrain berries...

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:13.880
It was my duty to bring these back.
That's what Virgo Asmita...

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.040
Asmita?

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:16.860
I'm...

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:18.420
tired...

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.760
Tenma!

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:20.670
Yato...

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:25.740
I really want to get back to Earth.

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:29.810
Oh, no... Only one bloom
remains on the flower bracelet.

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:32.770
All right, come on!

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:35.810
I'll carry you as many times as it takes.

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:38.570
You idiot, Tenma!

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:40.820
Thanks, Yato.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:03.340
Have your doubts been assuaged, Asmita?

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:08.470
Yes. Forgive my many indiscretions.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.310
Do not worry.

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.730
I knew that you, born without eyesight,

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:16.860
felt a great many things and had many doubts.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:21.540
Yes. On Earth, my senses other
than eyesight, are overwhelmed.

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:24.730
And I am always filled with doubt and suffering.

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:28.830
How can there be any meaning to such an Earth?

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:29.870
However...

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:33.170
You met Tenma in the Underworld?

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:35.750
What did he seem like, in your opinion?

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:42.470
Very passionate. A fool, but such a human man...

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:52.600
<i>It seems maintaining the barrier is exhausting.</i>

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:53.980
Athena...

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:58.020
I have a humble request.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:06.730
So, you have finally come back to your house, Dohko.

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:13.380
Asmita, you also left the house of Virgo.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:14.660
Where were you?

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.850
Just an audience with Athena.

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:18.500
Huh?

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:21.880
No reason to be so shocked.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.550
Dohko...

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:28.360
Your disciple...
He's a bit rough around the edges,

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.930
but he's a good man.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:32.570
H-How do you know Tenma?

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:35.080
Asmita, where are you going?

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.310
How...

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:41.680
I am Virgo Asmita. Nothing more, nothing less.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:45.690
Wherever Saints go,
there is death. It's a given.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:47.550
Asmita...

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:55.110
Tenma, we're almost there.

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:56.420
When we get back to Earth,

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:59.210
you've got to greet Lady Athena,
show her how alive you are!

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.710
We're nearly to the Yomotsu Hirasaka Path.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:03.050
All right!

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:11.590
What?!

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:16.600
You didn't think you could just walk out,
did you, Saints?

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:21.360
I'm the Deadly Beetle Stand,
of the Heavenly Ugly Star!

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.990
Crap...

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:26.860
I heard the Great Falls of Blood had crumbled.

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:31.490
To think it was you Saints...

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.240
Die!

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:36.750
Yuzuriha!

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.390
Take Tenma and go ahead.

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:42.100
There's no more time!

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:43.000
Yato...

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:46.380
We'll return to the Sanctuary
if it's the last thing I do, Tenma!

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.770
You're awake.

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:07.410
You're in Jamir.

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:09.900
You've returned alive from
your journey, Pegasus Saint.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.610
Jamir?

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:15.280
Then you're the Master Yato mentioned.

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:18.420
It seems you have safely completed your mission.

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:19.790
Good job.

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:22.040
Yeah...

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.790
Are Yato and Yuzuriha okay?

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:32.220
Hey! Yato!

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:35.940
We were attacked by a Specter
at the Yomotsu Hirasaka Path.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:39.220
He... told us to go ahead,

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.930
and he stayed behind at the path.

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:43.600
No...

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:45.610
Are you a fool?

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:50.110
I mean, I said I wanted to go home.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.610
But to come back to life and find you dead...

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:57.490
It doesn't feel good. Did you consider that?

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.200
Yato!

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:06.440
Where's that confidence now?

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:09.030
Aren't unicorns horses?

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:11.170
Then I'll ride you.

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:15.300
Get...

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:17.930
Get off me, you bastard!

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:19.810
Don't underestimate me!

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:21.310
You beetle!

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:26.440
You're underestimating me!

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.860
<i>Stand By Me!</i>

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:35.300
I'll finish you with the next one.

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:41.750
<i>Oh no, and I promised I'd make it
back to the Sanctuary.</i>

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.860
<i>Just one more...</i>

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:53.300
<i>Unicorn Gallop!</i>

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:02.890
Wh-What?

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:09.770
Huh? The Unicorn Saint's gone?

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:21.350
I'm alive...

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:24.160
You must have been protected by Athena's sword.

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:29.170
The sword carries Athena's prayer
for the Saints.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:32.640
The protection emitted by the sword

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:35.420
must have pulled you back into this world.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.090
Oh, yeah... Hey, Yato!

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:40.220
What do you want? What are you doing?

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:45.320
Thanks. I'm glad you're safe.

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:46.730
That all three of us are...

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:49.980
Yeah.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:55.140
Looks like it's too early to celebrate.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:59.140
It must be enemy pursuit from the Underworld.

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:01.030
They're here sooner than I expected.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:06.390
Is that where they are?
The stupid Saints, who were foolish enough

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:08.500
to steal goldenrain berries?

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:11.480
Yeah. Lady Pandora's orders were,

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:13.880
above all, to recover the goldenrain berries.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:14.550
But!

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:18.870
If they resist, show no mercy.
Kill them all!

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:19.800
Don't hold back!

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:27.140
<i>What?</i>

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:28.060
<i>Something's strange.</i>

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:33.060
<i>Was the valley this... This long?</i>

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.650
By the way...

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:40.710
Think of that path as leading
to your home, the Underworld.

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:43.760
What...

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:46.980
What are you doing here?

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.340
Virgo Asmita!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:11:01.010
Putting an end to you, of course, Specters.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:02.680
Wh-What?

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:07.790
<i>That Cosmo... There's no mistake.
It's Virgo Asmita!</i>

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:10.830
What's that bastard doing this time?

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:12.650
That bastard?

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.940
That's a little harsh.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:22.110
I see you've safely completed your mission.
Take me to the Master.

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:27.410
These are the goldenrain berries
we retrieved from the Underworld.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:30.030
What will you use those berries for?

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:34.520
You heard from Yuzuriha that the
Specters are immortal, right?

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:40.520
These berries are fruit from the only
living thing in the Underworld,

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:45.140
the goldenrain tree. Thus, they're in
complete opposition to the Surplices,

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:47.390
created from Underworld minerals.

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:52.690
They counteract the Specters' immortality.
In other words,

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:58.190
they're a weapon to seal the Specters' spirits,
despite the Surplices' protection.

00:11:58.190 --> 00:11:59.720
These berries?

00:11:59.720 --> 00:12:03.630
Yeah. But these berries are useless alone.

00:12:03.630 --> 00:12:05.700
Huh? Then what do we do?

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:08.080
That's why I'm here.

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:11.600
To turn these berries into weapons,

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:14.470
you need the ultimate, most powerful Cosmo.

00:12:14.470 --> 00:12:15.750
Ultimate, most powerful Cosmo?

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:21.630
Yes. Have you heard of a Cosmo's essence?

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:29.730
Oh, well.

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:31.460
How sad.

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:34.990
Sylph Edward, of the Earthly Flying Star.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:36.730
Why?

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.770
Over there.

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:41.980
Cait Sith Cheshire, of the Earthly Beast Star.

00:12:42.550 --> 00:12:45.410
You have lived this long because of Lady Pandora.

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:49.710
But to be wiped out so easily,

00:12:49.710 --> 00:12:51.410
how can you face her?

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:55.870
Or did you encounter an
incredibly powerful enemy?

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:59.350
Well, whatever.

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:02.090
We don't die, anyway.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:08.140
See?

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:12.720
Just hurry and get those goldenrain berries back.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.570
What? Is that the Specter army?

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:29.930
The Specters I killed must have come back to life.

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:33.220
Crap. This is endless...

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:36.330
But we've got a Gold Saint.
It's a piece of cake.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:40.080
No. This time, you fight them yourselves.

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:44.970
Didn't I tell you I had things to do?

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:50.010
Yes... He has to raise himself to
the goldenrain tree's level.

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:53.260
The only one on Earth who can do that now...

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:56.770
is the blind Saint, Asmita.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:58.910
Only you.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:02.270
You're blind?

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:05.580
Yeah, but it's no problem.

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:10.280
Due to that, I can feel much more
than others can.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:13.540
I don't know your face, but I know your condition.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:17.940
I even know that you're still
stubbornly wearing that shabby Cloth.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.920
Master, Tenma's Cloth...

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:30.270
Are you sure, Asmita?

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:31.260
Yes.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:33.760
It's just blood I don't need.

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:43.830
We were wasting our time in
the Sanctuary's vicinity.

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:44.880
Go!

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:51.450
Don't be scared of a Gold Saint or two.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.830
Or I'll tell on you to Lady Pandora...

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:01.580
This Cosmo? Is it a Gold Saint's?

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:07.510
New Pegasus Cloth complete!

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:10.010
Are you my next opponent? You're tiny!

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:13.320
You're just like they say.

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:15.390
I'll play with you until you die.

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:17.350
<i>This Cloth is awesome!</i>

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.770
All right!

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:23.580
I just killed you...

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:25.150
You guys are so annoying.

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:28.470
We're immortal warriors.

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:32.660
As long as Lord Hades protects us,
we will come back to life endlessly.

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:39.910
Yes. We're immortal, unlike you Saints.

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:41.660
Sorry,

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:42.960
Asmita.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:48.550
This is no job for an old man like me.

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:54.930
That's not like you.
I'm exhilarated.

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:05.060
<i>I've lived in a world without light,
only accumulating Cosmo,</i>

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:08.070
<i>and finally, my life has meaning.</i>

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:16.070
What a nice wind.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:21.980
What a nice day.

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:25.780
Crap!

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.090
Don't go ahead alone, idiot!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:37.720
Thanks, Yato!

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:43.100
Right now, Asmita is purifying the
prayer beads and raising his Cosmo.

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:48.360
The Master has ordered us to protect
you guys until he's ready.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.990
Okay, I don't care if they're immortal!

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:53.820
I'll just kick their asses!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.240
Oh! What?

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:02.180
You!

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:06.650
<i>Unicorn Gallop!</i>

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.630
<i>Pegasus Meteor Fist!</i>

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.980
Crap! You guys are pretty thick.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:29.190
You fools, working so hard.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:32.070
Do you really not understand
what "immortal" means?

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:35.570
The protection of Lord Hades is all-powerful!

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:39.880
This is unending.

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:40.940
Yes,

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:44.120
exactly. There is no way.

00:17:44.530 --> 00:17:48.120
You never had any hope of winning.

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:00.260
<i>Uh-oh. Things don't look good.</i>

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:04.390
Edward! The palace!
Hurry and get to the top floor!

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:07.890
Like I'd let you!

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:11.400
Asmita?

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:14.430
This Cosmo is really strong.

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:16.440
How high will it go?

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.070
<i>I've got a bad feeling.</i>

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:22.740
<i>That Asmita. He didn't...</i>

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:30.250
<i>Athena...</i>

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:32.250
<i>Athena...</i>

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:38.690
<i>Asmita knows no light,
and has no intention of removing</i>

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.770
<i>the world's suffering and insecurity.</i>

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:44.220
<i>But...</i>

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:48.770
That little girl, Athena?

00:18:49.340 --> 00:18:53.520
In this life, she was born,
not as Athena,

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.970
but in a distant Italian town.

00:18:55.970 --> 00:18:58.930
I'm sure there is a reason for this.

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:04.030
She is not conscious of her Athena persona,
and is just a normal little girl.

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:09.540
I'm sure she's very lonely
at being taken from her friends.

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:13.040
<i>What a foolish goddess.</i>

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:22.280
<i>To be a goddess and choose a human birth...
To live that painful life...</i>

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:30.020
<i>How can such a god lead
the Earth to enlightenment?</i>

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:34.020
What is your purpose in the house of Virgo, Athena?

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:40.310
The Pope is worried.
You cannot go outside like that.

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:43.660
You know what I look like,
even closing your eyes?

00:19:44.190 --> 00:19:48.160
I'm not closing my eyes, Athena.
They're simply closed.

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:51.810
And because they are,
I can see the suffering of this world,

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:53.290
whether or not I wish.

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:58.550
Is that why you suffer so?

00:19:58.550 --> 00:19:59.950
<i>What?</i>

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:02.800
How about you?

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:06.180
You're a goddess, but your soul is in pain.

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.940
My pain does not matter.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:13.560
I'm fine this way because it means
I haven't forgotten my promise.

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:17.220
So it's okay for my soul to suffer forever.

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:22.030
<i>Oh, yes...</i>

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:24.570
<i>Heaven Supremacy on...</i>

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:26.800
<i>evil spirits of rivers and mountains!</i>

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:31.190
What is that power,
evil spirits of rivers and mountains?

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:33.750
Just hurry up and take care of
the Gold Saints atop the tower!

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:36.670
Crap!

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:39.690
Too late.

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:43.590
These spirits are your people, are they not?

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:45.710
<i>Treasures of the Heavens!</i>

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:50.100
This time, enjoy an eternal sleep.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:06.110
No.

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:09.070
He's dead. No way.

00:21:09.630 --> 00:21:11.860
This can't be... No.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:15.870
Asmita!

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:17.520
Tenma...

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:22.280
The world is so beautiful.

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:25.250
Look, light shines there.

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:28.010
Is there a settlement there?

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.540
People live there.

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:34.770
Through their worries and suffering,
there is also laughter.

00:21:35.840 --> 00:21:40.540
Yes. You look younger than I expected.

00:21:44.230 --> 00:21:47.030
When I saw you in the Underworld, and now...

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:50.530
You are just like Athena was that day,
when she was young.

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:52.540
Tenma...

00:21:53.030 --> 00:21:55.220
Take care of Athena for me.

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:06.050
The prayer beads that seal the
Specters' souls are complete.

00:22:06.870 --> 00:22:11.550
Now Athena's army can fight the
Specter army on an equal footing.

00:22:12.250 --> 00:22:15.560
In exchange for all of Asmita's Cosmo.

00:22:18.590 --> 00:22:19.660
Really...

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:22.170
I can't understand this.

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:26.480
You fucking idiot!

00:24:03.400 --> 00:24:04.290
Alone,

00:24:04.760 --> 00:24:08.000
what Virgo Asmita wanted to say to me...

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:12.380
I'm stupid, so I can't say this clearly,

00:24:12.380 --> 00:24:14.720
but I think I understand.

00:24:15.580 --> 00:24:18.470
For my friends who've died and become stars...

00:24:18.900 --> 00:24:21.870
I must keep going, the only way I know how.

00:24:23.440 --> 00:24:26.920
Next time on <i>Saint Seiya: The Lost Canvas –</i>

00:24:26.920 --> 00:24:28.250
<i>The Myth of Hades</i>...

00:24:28.940 --> 00:24:29.900
Giant Star.
